Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: allwinner: rg35xx-sp: fix the X and Y button pins

The shared device tree has X on PA3 and Y on PA2. On the test SP they are the
other way round, which sent BTN_WEST from the top button and BTN_NORTH from the
left one. Swap the pins, so the labels and codes match the buttons.
---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h700-anbernic-rg35xx-sp.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h700-anbernic-rg35xx-sp.dts
@@ -53,3 +53,17 @@
 &ohci0 {
 	status = "disabled";
 };
+
+/*
+ * The shared RG35XX device tree has X on PA3 and Y on PA2, but on the SP the top
+ * button, X, is on PA2 and the left button, Y, is on PA3.
+ */
+&gpio_keys_gamepad {
+	button-x {
+		gpios = <&pio 0 2 GPIO_ACTIVE_LOW>; /* PA2 */
+	};
+
+	button-y {
+		gpios = <&pio 0 3 GPIO_ACTIVE_LOW>; /* PA3 */
+	};
+};
